    "name": "Dead Watch",
    "steam_appid": 3464670,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464670/extras/b1179eacf19ba03fc025cdb48df3f96c.poster.avif?t=1755499691\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464670/extras/b1179eacf19ba03fc025cdb48df3f96c.webm?t=1755499691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464670/extras/b1179eacf19ba03fc025cdb48df3f96c.mp4?t=1755499691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a dark castle, surrounded by strangers. While searching for an exit, you stumble upon a murder, only to wake up again moments later. The victim is alive. No one remembers you. But the loop continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each reset erases your progress, but your character<strong> remembers everything. </strong>With every cycle, you gain new knowledge, unlocking new paths of exploration and dialogue routes with characters you meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find the exit, you\u2019ll need to explore the castle\u2019s hidden rooms, solve puzzles, and learn the lore behind the castle\u2019s past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The power to change the future </strong>- The future was designed to make you lose, but you have the power to remember past loops. Use your knowledge to alter the timeline to achieve a different future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timeline simulation</strong> - Each character has its own schedule during the loop. As you explore the castle, characters may move between rooms and do certain things depending on the time. <i>Your actions will affect their schedule</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No hand-holding\u00a0</strong>- The game respects your intelligence and expects you to piece the clues together on your own. There\u2019s no tutorial fairy to solve your puzzles, and no intrusive UI. Even timekeeping is diegetic, tracked only by the towering clock in the grand hall. Every breakthrough is earned, making each discovery feel truly rewarding.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464670/extras/b1179eacf19ba03fc025cdb48df3f96c.poster.avif?t=1755499691\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464670/extras/b1179eacf19ba03fc025cdb48df3f96c.webm?t=1755499691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464670/extras/b1179eacf19ba03fc025cdb48df3f96c.mp4?t=1755499691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a dark castle, surrounded by strangers. While searching for an exit, you stumble upon a murder, only to wake up again moments later. The victim is alive. No one remembers you. But the loop continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each reset erases your progress, but your character<strong> remembers everything. </strong>With every cycle, you gain new knowledge, unlocking new paths of exploration and dialogue routes with characters you meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find the exit, you\u2019ll need to explore the castle\u2019s hidden rooms, solve puzzles, and learn the lore behind the castle\u2019s past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The power to change the future </strong>- The future was designed to make you lose, but you have the power to remember past loops. Use your knowledge to alter the timeline to achieve a different future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timeline simulation</strong> - Each character has its own schedule during the loop. As you explore the castle, characters may move between rooms and do certain things depending on the time. <i>Your actions will affect their schedule</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No hand-holding\u00a0</strong>- The game respects your intelligence and expects you to piece the clues together on your own. There\u2019s no tutorial fairy to solve your puzzles, and no intrusive UI. Even timekeeping is diegetic, tracked only by the towering clock in the grand hall. Every breakthrough is earned, making each discovery feel truly rewarding.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You're stuck in a time loop \u231b. Whenever you find a dead body, you go back to the past. The only way to escape the loop is to cheat destiny &amp; change the future. Explore the castle and uncover its dark secrets to prevent the next killing",
